asr-000171
00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:15.200
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Mr. Speaker, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleagues, I rise to sponsor the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the Department of Social Welfare and Development.

asr-000172
00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:22.920
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: The proposed national budget carries the theme, People-Centered Growth for an Inclusive and Resilient Future.

asr-000173
00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:34.220
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Under it, P241.2 billion is proposed for the DSWD to support vulnerable families and provide assistance to those in need.

asr-000174
00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:44.640
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Behind that figure are people who cannot wait, a child who needs a nutritious meal, a family struggling to keep its children in school,

asr-000175
00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:51.660
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: an older person with no steady income, and a household rebuilding after a disaster.

asr-000176
00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:58.320
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: The DSWD reaches these families at different points in their lives.

asr-000177
00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:03.900
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: The Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program supports children's health and education.

asr-000178
00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:07.720
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Feeding and food assistance address hunger.

asr-000179
00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:12.100
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Protective services help people through crisis.

asr-000180
00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:15.160
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Livelihoods offer a path

asr-000181
00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:17.420
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: toward greater security.

asr-000182
00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:22.720
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Social pensions help older Filipinos meet their daily needs.

asr-000183
00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:27.120
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: These programs are strongest when they work together.

asr-000184
00:23:28.480 --> 00:23:31.960
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Emergency assistance helps a family get through today.

asr-000185
00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:39.040
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Education, nutrition, and livelihood opportunities can help change what tomorrow holds.

asr-000186
00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:45.040
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Madam Speaker, Congress must also ask what this appropriation will achieve.

asr-000187
00:23:45.200 --> 00:23:49.020
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Are eligible families receiving help on time?

asr-000188
00:23:49.660 --> 00:23:56.040
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Are we reaching communities that are hardest to serve, including island and remote barangays?

asr-000189
00:23:57.100 --> 00:24:03.680
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Are our programs helping households recover from hardships and build a more secure future?

asr-000190
00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:14.340
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: We owe the Filipino people accurate targeting, timely delivery, transparent spending, and results.

asr-000191
00:24:15.200 --> 00:24:17.460
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: They can feel in their daily lives.

asr-000192
00:24:18.460 --> 00:24:23.320
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Secretary Rex Gatchalian reported during the Committee on Appropriations briefing

asr-000193
00:24:23.320 --> 00:24:29.360
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: that the Department achieved nearly full utilization of its 2025 funds.

asr-000194
00:24:30.020 --> 00:24:32.480
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: That record deserves recognition.

asr-000195
00:24:33.160 --> 00:24:36.480
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: It also sets a standard for the year ahead.

asr-000196
00:24:36.620 --> 00:24:43.160
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Funds must be used effectively and assistance must reach the people for whom Congress provides it.

asr-000197
00:24:44.020 --> 00:24:44.980
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: The value of this budget

asr-000198
00:24:45.200 --> 00:25:02.640
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: will be measured in a child better nourished, a student able to remain in school, a family supported through a crisis, an older person treated with dignity, and a community able to recover after a disaster.

asr-000199
00:25:02.640 --> 00:25:18.440
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Our task is to turn public resources into public good. For social welfare, that means being present when the people need government most and helping families move forward, lasting security and opportunity.

asr-000200
00:25:18.440 --> 00:25:32.340
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: I therefore respectfully sponsor the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the Department of Social Welfare and Development and urge this Honorable Chamber to give it its careful consideration.

asr-000201
00:25:32.640 --> 00:25:34.120
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

