asr-001539
01:38:38.960 --> 01:38:44.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kasi daw Madam Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, mayabang daw ang mga Pilipino.

asr-001540
01:38:45.480 --> 01:38:48.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Palagastos daw ang mga Pilipino.

asr-001541
01:38:49.400 --> 01:38:56.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And take note, this is coming from the highest paid public official in our land.

asr-001542
01:38:58.560 --> 01:39:04.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Earning 52 million pesos at least per year.

asr-001543
01:39:05.940 --> 01:39:08.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, what would be the position?

asr-001544
01:39:08.960 --> 01:39:18.200
