asr-001545
01:39:19.200 --> 01:39:28.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Would the DSWD through the sponsor agree that in its own experience and data available,

asr-001546
01:39:29.480 --> 01:39:35.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: eh hindi naman ang problema yung paggastos, kundi Pilipinos are not really earning well.

asr-001547
01:39:35.800 --> 01:39:38.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, it's not a question of them consuming more.

asr-001548
01:39:38.960 --> 01:39:42.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: But it is a question of, are they earning enough?

asr-001549
01:39:43.200 --> 01:39:48.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, what would be the position of DSWD regarding this through the sponsor, Madam Speaker?

asr-001550
01:39:49.580 --> 01:39:52.880
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: The department does not agree with that position, Your Honor.

asr-001551
01:39:53.940 --> 01:40:00.260
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: In fact, it was observed by the department that Pilipinos, particularly the poor Pilipinos,

asr-001552
01:40:00.920 --> 01:40:08.120
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: those that are the clients of the department, are struggling so much to find its way

asr-001553
01:40:08.960 --> 01:40:11.340
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: so that they can have a better life, Your Honor, Madam Speaker.

asr-001554
