asr-003780
03:31:25.460 --> 03:31:30.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And we welcome that po. As soon as possible po, sana ma-furnish ang kinatawang ito ng report na ito.

asr-003781
03:31:30.960 --> 03:31:32.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor,

asr-003782
03:31:33.560 --> 03:31:41.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dahil po ang kinatawang ito ay kumakatawan sa mga manggagawa at binanggit nyo nga po na sumusunod ang kagawaran,

asr-003783
03:31:41.760 --> 03:31:51.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: particular dito sa FSL Act Provisions, kasama ba ang mga FSL interpreters sa ating Human Resource for Health Master Plan?

asr-003784
03:31:51.900 --> 03:32:00.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Meron po ba tayong nililikhang formal na plantilla positions para sa kanila at sa ating mga state hospitals at DOH retained facilities?

asr-003785
03:32:00.300 --> 03:32:00.500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yes.

asr-003786
03:32:06.900 --> 03:32:11.500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang initiative po ngayon ng DOH regarding this ay,

asr-003787
03:32:11.760 --> 03:32:17.620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: sinetrain yung mga healthcare workers para matuto po dito sa sign language.

asr-003788
03:32:18.320 --> 03:32:25.400
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Para sila po ang tumulong sa ating mga workers, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003789
03:32:25.540 --> 03:32:30.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Makikihingi na lang din po ng karampatang dokumento hinggil dito,

asr-003790
03:32:30.040 --> 03:32:36.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung ratio po ng mga FSL trained po natin na mga manggagawa.

asr-003791
03:32:37.900 --> 03:32:41.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alinsunod po sa pahayag ni PBBM ukol sa long-term capacity,

asr-003792
03:32:41.760 --> 03:32:45.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ano naman po ang kasalukuyang programa ng kagawaran,

asr-003793
03:32:47.200 --> 03:32:53.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kasama ang KWF o Komisyon sa Wikang Pilipino, being the lead agency na nagpapatupad ng FSL Act?

asr-003794
03:32:54.380 --> 03:32:59.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At papaano nakikipag-ugnayan po ang DOH sa mga accredited deaf institutions

asr-003795
03:32:59.820 --> 03:33:05.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: para magturo ng FSL sa ating mga doktor, NARS at mga administrative staff?

asr-003796
03:33:06.820 --> 03:33:10.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Meron po ba tayong budget o meron po bang target ang DOH?

asr-003797
03:33:10.360 --> 03:33:11.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa ilan?

asr-003798
03:33:11.180 --> 03:33:19.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang tina-target nito na ma-train for FSL, kasama po ba ito sa plano ng DOH?

asr-003799
03:33:19.720 --> 03:33:20.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker.

asr-003800
03:33:34.620 --> 03:33:36.440
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-003801
03:33:36.440 --> 03:33:40.440
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, ito po yung ginagawa ng DOH with regards to the FSL.

asr-003802
03:33:41.180 --> 03:33:51.300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Sa health facilities of the DOH and local government units, seek the guidance and assistance of the Komisyon sa Wikang Pilipino

asr-003803
03:33:51.300 --> 03:34:02.320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and or University of the Philippines for capacity building of the respective workforce on FSL in accordance with the law.

asr-003804
03:34:02.320 --> 03:34:11.160
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At isa pa po yung ating mga health facilities ng DOH and LGUs in partnership with the relevant stakeholders and community groups,

asr-003805
03:34:11.180 --> 03:34:25.020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: promote awareness and appreciation campaigns on FSL, including the observance of the International Day of Sign Languages every September 23.

asr-003806
03:34:25.440 --> 03:34:31.060
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And we will also submit a report with regards to this, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-003807
03:34:31.140 --> 03:34:34.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Maraming salamat po sa distinguished sponsor natin.

asr-003808
03:34:35.160 --> 03:34:37.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dako naman po tayo sa mental health program.

asr-003809
03:34:38.160 --> 03:34:40.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano po ang ginagawa ng kagawaran?

asr-003810
03:34:41.180 --> 03:34:51.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Makapag-establish o makapag-develop ng community-based mental health programs for all population groups and especially for children.

asr-003811
03:34:53.700 --> 03:34:59.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ito po ba ang mga inisyatibo ng kagawaran ay makikita natin sa PPAs ng kagawaran?

asr-003812
03:35:00.360 --> 03:35:07.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Magkano po ang nailagak ng kagawaran for 2025 and this year?

asr-003813
03:35:07.720 --> 03:35:11.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At ano po ang projection o hinihinging budget?

asr-003814
03:35:11.180 --> 03:35:14.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dito para sa susunod na taon, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003815
03:35:19.540 --> 03:35:40.860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So for 2027, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, meron po tayong nakalagay sa NEP na 3.34 billion for mental health related programs across NCD prevention and control.

asr-003816
03:35:41.180 --> 03:36:10.500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So ito po para sa governance ng RA-11036 or mental health law, promotion and prevention ng MNS health literacy, peer-to-peer, school and workplace based mental health services, psychological first aid, MHPSS guidelines on ethical portrayal of

asr-003817
03:36:10.500 --> 03:36:10.940
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: suicide screening,

asr-003818
03:36:11.180 --> 03:36:46.880
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: MNS screening, risk of substance abuse, drug dependency examination, MH access program, community-based mental health and community-based drug rehab program, inpatient and outpatient benefit, sa 432 general mental health providers and 21 specialty mental health providers.

asr-003819
03:36:47.880 --> 03:37:08.220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Psychologists, 2,128; psychiatrists, 700; DevPed, 104; speech path, 1,225, but only 12 in health facilities.

asr-003820
03:37:15.220 --> 03:37:25.940
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Sa occupational therapists, 3,401 but only 246 in healthcare facilities in the country, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003821
03:37:26.100 --> 03:37:29.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Makikihingi na lang din po ng datos na binanggit ko.

asr-003822
03:37:29.640 --> 03:37:30.160
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: We will do.

asr-003822-split-2
03:37:30.160 --> 03:37:38.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So Pinapatupad, Mr. Speaker, ng Department of Health yung World Health Organization's Mental Health Gap Action Program

asr-003823
03:37:38.580 --> 03:37:44.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: para makapag-train ng primary care workers in non-specialized settings.

asr-003824
03:37:45.500 --> 03:37:55.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano po ang ginagawa ng kagawaran para makapag-train ng primary health care workers under this program, o yung MHGAP, Mr. Speaker?

asr-003825
03:37:55.640 --> 03:38:01.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa rugtong din po nito, ay maaari rin po bang mabigyan ang representasyong ito

asr-003826
03:38:01.640 --> 03:38:09.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng status sa implementation ng Mental Health Strategic Framework 2024 to 2028.

asr-003827
03:38:13.820 --> 03:38:20.940
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang kasalukuyang ginagawa, Mr. Speaker, English Colleague, ito pong primary health care capacity

asr-003828
03:38:20.940 --> 03:38:30.440
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: has been expanded to 5,249 MHGAP trained personnel

asr-003829
03:38:30.440 --> 03:38:31.620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and

asr-003830
03:38:31.620 --> 03:38:38.680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: This is about 85.06% of RHUs as of September 2026.

asr-003831
03:38:39.300 --> 03:38:44.460
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Continuous program po ito at tuloy-tuloy lang po ang kanilang ginagawang trainings.

asr-003832
03:38:45.020 --> 03:38:48.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, sa ating kaibigan na sponsor.

asr-003833
03:38:49.180 --> 03:38:54.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa huling set po ng mga katanungan natin ay papatungkol naman po ito sa Health Human Resource.

asr-003834
03:38:55.720 --> 03:38:59.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa usapin po ng kalusugan, walang serbisyo kung walang tao.

asr-003835
03:39:00.540 --> 03:39:01.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That is a basic fact.

asr-003836
03:39:01.620 --> 03:39:10.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Section 23 of the Universal Health Care Act mandates the DOH to formulate and implement

asr-003837
03:39:10.100 --> 03:39:17.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: National Health Human Resource Master Plan to ensure the proper generation, recruitment, retooling,

asr-003838
03:39:18.000 --> 03:39:22.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: deployment, and retention of health workers across all levels of care.

asr-003839
03:39:23.600 --> 03:39:29.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Despite this mandate, acute spatial maldistribution, brain drain, and data fragmentation

asr-003840
03:39:29.620 --> 03:39:30.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: persist.

asr-003841
03:39:31.620 --> 03:39:32.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Across regions.

asr-003842
03:39:32.840 --> 03:39:40.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maari po bang magbigay ng update ang Department of Health tungkol po dito sa Health Human Resource Master Plan?

asr-003843
03:39:47.540 --> 03:39:54.760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang ginagawa po ng ating DOH with regards to this is that meron silang medical education.

asr-003844
03:39:55.200 --> 03:39:59.780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: They're expanding it through 82 medical schools nationwide.

asr-003845
03:40:00.300 --> 03:40:01.240
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Para makapagproduce.

asr-003846
03:40:01.620 --> 03:40:03.960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Para makapagproduce ng mga healthcare professionals.

asr-003847
03:40:04.960 --> 03:40:29.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: While government-supported medical scholars increased from 508 in academic year 2017 to 2018 to about 3,507 in academic year 2025-2026.

asr-003848
03:40:29.380 --> 03:40:31.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Largely through the...

asr-003849
03:40:31.620 --> 03:40:34.200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: MSRS program.

asr-003850
03:40:36.920 --> 03:40:43.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker, in the interest of time po, ipasok ko na lang ito bilang mga huling katanungan.

asr-003851
03:40:43.680 --> 03:40:54.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: May plano po ba ang DOH na i-include ang other essential health workers and allied health professionals,

asr-003852
03:40:55.480 --> 03:41:00.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sanitation inspectors, emergency medical technicians, and community nutrition workers?

asr-003853
03:41:01.620 --> 03:41:08.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And lastly, tungkol naman po sa purok kalusugan, maari po bang makapagbigay na lang ng report

asr-003854
03:41:08.840 --> 03:41:17.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang kagawaran through the sponsor sa kung pa paano iniimplementaan ang kagawaran ang purok kalusugan?

asr-003855
03:41:19.200 --> 03:41:29.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasama na rin kung ano ang ginagawa ng DOH para sa ating mga barangay health workers at sityo coordinators, Mr. Speaker?

asr-003856
03:41:30.960 --> 03:41:31.420
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Yes.

asr-003857
03:41:31.620 --> 03:41:38.800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleagues, we will submit all of those requested data and information.

asr-003858
03:41:39.000 --> 03:41:39.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003859
03:41:40.280 --> 03:41:48.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nagpapasalamat po tayo sa ating kaibigan na sponsor at binibigyang pansin din po natin ang ating mga kasama sa civil society organizations,

asr-003860
03:41:48.940 --> 03:41:52.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: particular ang Social Watch Philippines and Alternative Budget Initiative.

asr-003861
03:41:53.580 --> 03:42:00.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hopefully po ay magpatuloy yung ganitong bukas na talakayan sa pagitan ng kagawaran at ng ating mga stakeholders

asr-003862
03:42:00.500 --> 03:42:02.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa civil society organizations.

asr-003874
03:42:02.280 --> 03:42:05.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: With that, Mr. Speaker, maraming salamat po.

asr-003875
03:42:05.660 --> 03:42:06.640
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003876
03:42:07.280 --> 03:42:09.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you, Honorable San Fernando.

asr-003877
03:42:10.100 --> 03:42:10.640
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Majority Leader.

asr-003878
