Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Iris Montes of the Partylist 4K to interpellate on the budget of the DOH.

asr-003879
03:42:25.160 --> 03:42:29.140
Deputy Speaker Alfredo "Albee" B. Benitez: Representative Iris Montes is recognized to interpellate the sponsor.

asr-003880
03:42:29.800 --> 03:42:30.960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003881
03:42:30.960 --> 03:42:31.580
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Magandang.

asr-003882
03:42:31.620 --> 03:42:37.900
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Magandang araw po, kagalang-galang na sponsor at sa mga taga-DOH, PhilHealth and attached agencies.

asr-003883
03:42:39.040 --> 03:42:46.800
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Mr. Speaker, this representation would like to examine the implementation of RA-11223 or the UHC Act

asr-003884
03:42:46.800 --> 03:42:53.100
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: in relation to the proposed 2027 budget of the Department of Health and the PhilHealth.

asr-003885
03:42:53.100 --> 03:43:01.600
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Given the very limited time I have right now and considering that the Congressional Oversight Committee,

asr-003886
03:43:01.620 --> 03:43:14.460
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: on universal healthcare, has last convened in 2020, I'd like to take this opportunity to inquire to track the progress of UHC implementation

asr-003887
03:43:14.460 --> 03:43:20.300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: and identify areas required during urgent policy and budgetary attention.

asr-003888
