04:13:41.320 --> 04:13:44.560
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 170 billion po yung

asr-004714
04:13:44.560 --> 04:13:44.780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: gap.

asr-004715
04:13:46.340 --> 04:13:48.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakalaki po at nakakalula

asr-004716
04:13:48.200 --> 04:13:50.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng gap, no? Para i-cover

asr-004717
04:13:50.320 --> 04:13:52.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung health services ng ating

asr-004718
04:13:52.500 --> 04:13:54.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pong mga indirect

asr-004719
04:13:54.120 --> 04:13:55.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: contributors. So,

asr-004720
04:13:56.100 --> 04:13:58.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kinakilangan po talaga na makita

asr-004721
04:13:58.180 --> 04:14:00.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at ma-appreciate natin yung malaking

asr-004722
04:14:00.340 --> 04:14:02.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kakulangan for PhilHealth to be

asr-004723
04:14:02.380 --> 04:14:04.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: able to fulfill its mandate

asr-004724
04:14:04.200 --> 04:14:05.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at also to provide

asr-004725
04:14:05.940 --> 04:14:08.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung makatao at

asr-004726
04:14:08.160 --> 04:14:10.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: efficienting servisyo sa ating mga kababayan,

asr-004727
04:14:10.440 --> 04:14:12.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: lalong-lalo na ang mga indirect

asr-004728
04:14:12.200 --> 04:14:14.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: contributors. Dako naman po

asr-004729
04:14:14.460 --> 04:14:16.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ako doon sa mga direct contributors.

asr-004730
04:14:16.820 --> 04:14:18.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ilan pong direct contributors

asr-004731
04:14:18.180 --> 04:14:19.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang registered sa inyong sistema

asr-004732
04:14:19.680 --> 04:14:22.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at magkano po ang nakukuha nating premium

asr-004733
04:14:22.300 --> 04:14:23.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: contributions sa kanila?

asr-004734
04:14:28.180 --> 04:14:31.920
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker,

asr-004735
04:14:32.220 --> 04:14:33.540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Honorable Colleague, yung

asr-004736
04:14:33.540 --> 04:14:38.100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: sagot po sa tanong is

asr-004737
04:14:38.100 --> 04:14:39.780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 33.3 million.

asr-004738
04:14:41.620 --> 04:14:44.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At magkano po yung nakukuha natin contributions

asr-004739
04:14:44.140 --> 04:14:45.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: from our direct contributors,

asr-004740
04:14:46.460 --> 04:14:48.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague?

asr-004741
04:14:50.940 --> 04:14:52.180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 209 billion,

asr-004742
04:14:52.320 --> 04:14:54.120
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

asr-004743
04:14:54.820 --> 04:14:56.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 209 billion, no?

asr-004744
04:14:56.280 --> 04:14:57.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, ilan po ang estimated

asr-004745
04:14:58.180 --> 04:14:59.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: contributors natin na nakapagbabayad

asr-004746
04:15:00.000 --> 04:15:01.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: consistently ng kanilang contributions.

asr-004747
04:15:02.200 --> 04:15:03.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Out of the 33 million members,

asr-004748
04:15:05.060 --> 04:15:05.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ilan po dyan yung,

asr-004749
04:15:06.000 --> 04:15:07.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ayan po yung ating mga direct contributors,

asr-004750
04:15:08.040 --> 04:15:10.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ilan po yung consistently nakakabayad sa kanila?

asr-004751
04:15:10.400 --> 04:15:11.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kahit po prosyento lamang.

asr-004752
04:15:12.440 --> 04:15:14.640
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang, in absolute numbers,

asr-004753
04:15:14.920 --> 04:15:18.040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ang nakakabayad po ng consistent for 12 months

asr-004754
04:15:18.040 --> 04:15:21.340
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: is 10.5 million, Mr. Speaker,

asr-004755
04:15:22.340 --> 04:15:23.140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Honorable Colleague.

asr-004756
04:15:23.140 --> 04:15:24.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So that's how many percent?

asr-004757
04:15:26.900 --> 04:15:29.140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: That is around 31%.

asr-004758
04:15:29.140 --> 04:15:30.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 31%.

asr-004759
04:15:30.620 --> 04:15:32.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So talaga po, not even half

asr-004760
04:15:32.940 --> 04:15:34.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung nakakabayad consistently

asr-004761
04:15:34.800 --> 04:15:36.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng kanilang premium.

asr-004762
04:15:37.540 --> 04:15:39.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Would Phil Health know

asr-004763
04:15:39.100 --> 04:15:42.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kung gano'ng karami ang active and registered contributors po

asr-004764
04:15:42.180 --> 04:15:44.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng SSS at GSIS?

asr-004765
04:15:50.180 --> 04:15:53.320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: They have a rough estimate, Mr. Speaker,

asr-004766
04:15:53.500 --> 04:15:54.320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Honorable Colleague.

asr-004767
04:15:54.980 --> 04:15:56.880
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And according to them,

asr-004768
04:15:56.940 --> 04:15:58.360
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: it's around 18 million.

asr-004769
04:15:59.140 --> 04:16:02.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 18 million for both SSS and GSIS?

asr-004770
04:16:07.260 --> 04:16:12.300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: That's for SSS and they would need to double check

asr-004771
04:16:12.300 --> 04:16:16.140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: with regards to the number of members from GSIS.

asr-004772
04:16:21.480 --> 04:16:24.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pasensya na po, medyo mahalaga itong tanong na ito

asr-004773
04:16:24.300 --> 04:16:27.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: doon sa point that this representation would like to drive at,

asr-004774
04:16:27.400 --> 04:16:28.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-004775
04:16:29.140 --> 04:16:31.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: again po, ilan po ang alam natin na registered

asr-004776
04:16:31.560 --> 04:16:35.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: or active contributors ng SSS at GSIS?

asr-004777
04:16:35.940 --> 04:16:39.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Baka lang po mahugot natin mula sa Google.

asr-004778
04:16:41.180 --> 04:16:42.960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague,

asr-004779
04:16:43.060 --> 04:16:45.860
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: they are validating the numbers.

asr-004780
04:16:46.300 --> 04:16:49.020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kung pwede pong mamaya po ibibigay po natin.

asr-004781
04:16:49.020 --> 04:16:52.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-004782
04:16:52.500 --> 04:16:57.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sigurado po ako, mas malaki po yung kanila pong active contributors

asr-004783
04:16:57.260 --> 04:16:58.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kesa sa...

asr-004784
04:16:59.140 --> 04:17:01.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: active contributors ng PhilHealth.

asr-004785
04:17:01.680 --> 04:17:02.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Inuulit ko po,

asr-004786
04:17:02.940 --> 04:17:05.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: while waiting for the figures,

asr-004787
04:17:05.580 --> 04:17:06.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I can confidently say,

asr-004788
04:17:07.080 --> 04:17:09.440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: more than the active contributors of PhilHealth,

asr-004789
04:17:09.680 --> 04:17:13.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung active contributors ng GSIS at saka po ng SSS.

asr-004790
04:17:14.140 --> 04:17:17.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And I won't be surprised kung meron pong asymmetry

asr-004791
04:17:17.160 --> 04:17:23.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kasi bakit mas maraming active contributors sa GSIS at saka sa SSS.

asr-004792
04:17:24.240 --> 04:17:26.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Which leads me to a very important point

asr-004793
04:17:26.600 --> 04:17:28.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: which would later on be a proposal

asr-004794
04:17:28.340 --> 04:17:30.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: to the PhilHealth and to the DOH.

asr-004795
04:17:31.160 --> 04:17:34.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung ganun po, sumasang-ayon ba ang PhilHealth

asr-004796
04:17:34.020 --> 04:17:36.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: that we should institute reforms

asr-004797
04:17:36.180 --> 04:17:38.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: in order to efficiently collect premiums?

asr-004798
04:17:39.300 --> 04:17:42.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Baka po, we can look into partnership with SSS,

asr-004799
04:17:43.160 --> 04:17:45.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: GSIS, or in the long run, even with BIR.

asr-004800
04:17:46.860 --> 04:17:50.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Does PhilHealth have plans to strengthen its coordination

asr-004801
04:17:50.660 --> 04:17:53.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: with other agencies to collect the premiums?

asr-004802
04:17:53.980 --> 04:17:56.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At sigurado po ako, hindi lamang ito magiging mas efficient,

asr-004803
04:17:57.340 --> 04:17:58.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: makakabawas pa po.

asr-004804
04:17:58.340 --> 04:18:01.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa operating costs in terms of collection.

asr-004805
04:18:05.500 --> 04:18:08.180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The answer to that question, Mr. Speaker,

asr-004806
04:18:08.540 --> 04:18:10.640
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Honorable Colleague, is yes.

asr-004807
04:18:11.260 --> 04:18:15.560
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Tama po, to make the collection more efficient.

asr-004808
04:18:16.600 --> 04:18:19.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Sa ngayon po, data sharing lang po ang nangyayari.

asr-004809
04:18:20.020 --> 04:18:23.220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pero ang gustong mangyayari ng DOH and PhilHealth in the future

asr-004810
04:18:23.220 --> 04:18:27.340
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: is that these partner agencies

asr-004811
04:18:27.340 --> 04:18:31.320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: or government corporation should collect the data

asr-004812
04:18:31.320 --> 04:18:37.220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at i-share po sa PhilHealth para mas maging efficient po yung collection.

asr-004813
04:18:37.840 --> 04:18:40.800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And that is what they are working on right now,

asr-004814
04:18:40.900 --> 04:18:42.720
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

asr-004815
04:18:43.100 --> 04:18:44.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague,

asr-004816
04:18:44.660 --> 04:18:49.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: are we also looking at the possibility of entering into partnership

asr-004817
04:18:49.140 --> 04:18:54.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: with these corporations in terms of being collecting agents also of PhilHealth?

asr-004818
04:18:55.060 --> 04:18:57.320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The answer, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague,

asr-004819
04:18:57.340 --> 04:18:58.680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: is yes.

asr-004820
04:18:59.340 --> 04:19:03.520
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Na through this formalization of partnership

asr-004821
04:19:03.520 --> 04:19:06.340
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: na sila na mag-collect on behalf of PhilHealth

asr-004822
04:19:06.960 --> 04:19:08.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para mas maging efficient.

asr-004823
04:19:09.060 --> 04:19:10.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May timeline na po ba tayo dito?

asr-004824
04:19:10.680 --> 04:19:10.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Okay.

asr-004825
04:19:25.500 --> 04:19:27.080
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Right now, Mr. Speaker,

asr-004826
04:19:27.080 --> 04:19:28.360
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague,

asr-004827
04:19:28.360 --> 04:19:33.160
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: merong high-level discussion with the mentioned agencies

asr-004828
04:19:33.160 --> 04:19:38.600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at ang maganda po dito, kasama ang leadership ng DOF

asr-004829
04:19:38.600 --> 04:19:42.400
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: para talagang hopefully they would agree

asr-004830
04:19:42.400 --> 04:19:46.200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at mas maging efficient po yung collection in the future.

asr-004831
04:19:46.200 --> 04:19:48.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sana po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-004832
04:19:48.840 --> 04:19:52.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mas maging mabilis yung pacing ng ating high-level discussions

asr-004833
04:19:52.600 --> 04:19:56.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: which could eventually be translated into circular and necessary policies.

asr-004834
04:19:56.840 --> 04:19:59.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At kung mangangailangan po ng legislation,

asr-004835
04:19:59.160 --> 04:20:02.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: we are very open to support the PhilHealth and the DOH

asr-004836
04:20:02.560 --> 04:20:04.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: towards this direction.

asr-004837
04:20:04.020 --> 04:20:06.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mahalaga po yung efficiency ng collection ng premium

asr-004838
04:20:06.840 --> 04:20:09.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kasi earlier na-illustrate ko po kung gaano kalayo

asr-004839
04:20:09.900 --> 04:20:13.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung kailangan nating habulin to be able to fully cover

asr-004840
04:20:13.160 --> 04:20:16.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: both direct and indirect contributors of the PhilHealth.

asr-004841
04:20:16.840 --> 04:20:21.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: For the record lang po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-004842
04:20:21.080 --> 04:20:24.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ano po yung mga improvements natin in terms of benefits

asr-004843
04:20:24.340 --> 04:20:26.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: that are underway for 2027?

asr-004844
04:20:26.840 --> 04:20:31.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po yung aabangan ng ating mga kababayan sa PhilHealth sa taong 2027?

asr-004845
04:20:40.840 --> 04:20:46.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, if I may enumerate one by one.

asr-004846
04:20:46.840 --> 04:20:56.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, una po yung tuberculosis inclusion of FLDs in gamot by January 1, 2027.

asr-004847
04:20:56.840 --> 04:21:04.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: NDOTS package enhanced and MDR package in 2027.

asr-004848
04:21:04.840 --> 04:21:13.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: HIV targeted publication of HOPE treats and HOPE prevents circular by December 1.

asr-004849
04:21:13.840 --> 04:21:20.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ang pangatlo po ay sa mga cancers naman, cervical, prostate, lung, liver, uterine, and ovarian

asr-004850
04:21:20.840 --> 04:21:24.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: under development for 2027.

asr-004851
04:21:26.840 --> 04:21:34.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Family planning inclusion of contraceptives in gamot by January 1, 2027.

asr-004852
04:21:34.840 --> 04:21:37.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Hepatitis under development po ito.

asr-004853
04:21:37.840 --> 04:21:40.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Leprosy is also under development.

asr-004854
04:21:40.840 --> 04:21:51.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Maternity and newborn care enhanced package issued last May.

asr-004855
04:21:51.840 --> 04:21:54.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ongoing po ang development work for inclusion of contraceptives.

asr-004856
04:21:54.840 --> 04:22:01.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: As postpartum package.

asr-004857
04:22:01.840 --> 04:22:09.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Leukemia naman po under development sa CWDs or children with disabilities.

asr-004858
04:22:09.840 --> 04:22:14.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Ito po ay mangyayari due for fourth quarter of this year.

asr-004859
04:22:24.840 --> 04:22:32.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, kasama po sa children with disability, ito pong Z package is also under review.

asr-004860
04:22:32.840 --> 04:22:35.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Cardiac arrhythmia under study.

asr-004861
04:22:35.840 --> 04:22:41.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Congenital heart disorder is also under study.

asr-004862
04:22:41.840 --> 04:22:46.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, these are some of the expanded packages na ginagawa po ng PhilHealth and [unclear].

asr-004863
04:22:46.840 --> 04:22:48.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa dental po, meron po ba?

asr-004864
04:22:48.840 --> 04:22:53.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Because oral care is also very important.

asr-004865
04:22:53.840 --> 04:22:56.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: It's also very important, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-004866
04:23:02.840 --> 04:23:08.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Meron po, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleagues, sa Q4 of 2027 naman po.

asr-004867
04:23:08.840 --> 04:23:11.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, Q4 of 2027, yung sa dental po natin.

asr-004868
04:23:11.840 --> 04:23:17.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, it's very good to hear that there are a lot of reforms underway

asr-004869
04:23:17.840 --> 04:23:20.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: under the new leadership of PhilHealth.

asr-004870
04:23:20.840 --> 04:23:22.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Gusto po nating maramdaman ng ordinaryong Pilipino,

asr-004871
04:23:22.840 --> 04:23:24.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na may PhilHealth tayo.

asr-004872
04:23:24.840 --> 04:23:31.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Gusto nating maramdaman ng mga direct contributors na sulit ang kanilang bawat pisong ibinabayad sa PhilHealth.

asr-004873
04:23:31.840 --> 04:23:39.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At masalong gusto nating maramdaman ng mga indirect contributors natin na may gobyernong handang sumalo at yumakap sa kanila.

asr-004874
04:23:39.840 --> 04:23:40.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Good Sponsor,

asr-004875
04:23:40.840 --> 04:23:46.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Akbayan urges PhilHealth to explore ways to collect premiums more efficiently,

asr-004876
04:23:46.840 --> 04:23:49.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: both from the private and public sector.

asr-004877
04:23:49.840 --> 04:23:51.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This representation, Mr. Speaker,

asr-004878
04:23:51.840 --> 04:23:59.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: supports the increase of the budget of PhilHealth up to the amount that this government owes our indirect contributors.

asr-004879
04:23:59.840 --> 04:24:04.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Tapatan naman natin ang binabayad ng direct contributors through premium subsidies.

asr-004880
04:24:04.840 --> 04:24:08.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: After all, this is the essence of solidarity.

asr-004881
04:24:08.840 --> 04:24:11.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This is the essence of universal healthcare.

asr-004882
04:24:11.840 --> 04:24:15.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, I'd like to move on to another issue,

asr-004883
04:24:15.840 --> 04:24:20.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and that is the issue of injectable PrEP. Ito po yung pre-exposure prophylaxis natin.

asr-004884
04:24:21.840 --> 04:24:27.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Lenacapavir is a long-acting injectable form of PrEP given twice a year.

asr-004885
04:24:27.840 --> 04:24:33.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: In July 2025, WHO recommended it as an additional PrEP option.

asr-004886
04:24:33.840 --> 04:24:39.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: In fact, the US FDA approved it in June 2025.

asr-004887
04:24:39.840 --> 04:24:48.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: In February 2026, the Department of Health announced publicly that injectable PrEP was coming to the Philippines through PEPFAR.

asr-004888
04:24:48.840 --> 04:24:50.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero magpipitong buwan na po.

asr-004889
04:24:50.840 --> 04:24:57.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Wala pa ring acceptance decision, registration issuance at rollout date for Lenacapavir.

asr-004890
04:24:57.840 --> 04:25:10.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, does the Health Secretary consider Lenacapavir a critically needed drug under AO 2020-001?

asr-004891
04:25:12.840 --> 04:25:16.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The answer, Mr. Speaker, honorable colleague, is yes.

asr-004892
04:25:20.840 --> 04:25:31.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: It's already recognized by the DOH under Administrative Order No. 2026-0005.

asr-004893
04:25:31.840 --> 04:25:38.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And would the good Secretary consider Lenacapavir a game-changer sa ating HIV response?

asr-004894
04:25:38.840 --> 04:25:42.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Will it save lives?

asr-004895
04:25:42.840 --> 04:25:48.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The answer is yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004896
04:25:48.840 --> 04:25:50.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: That is one of the options.

asr-004897
04:25:50.840 --> 04:25:58.840
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And it is still being validated as we speak, Mr. Speaker, honorable colleague.

asr-004898
04:25:58.840 --> 04:26:06.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, honorable colleague, the most important question in this series is, will the Secretary sign the determination?

asr-004899
04:26:06.840 --> 04:26:12.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Can the good Secretary give us a timeline for the signing of this determination?

asr-004902
04:26:30.860 --> 04:26:38.720
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Right now, Mr. Speaker, honorable colleague, kina-fast-track po ito ng ating Kalihim ng DOH with the FDA.

asr-004904
04:26:40.840 --> 04:26:49.220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At kapag lumabas na po yung Certificate of Product Registration, ay dun po.

asr-004905
04:26:56.040 --> 04:26:59.220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Pwede na pong gamitin ito specific to that cohort.

asr-004906
04:26:59.720 --> 04:27:04.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague. Medyo kinabahan po ako na marinig ko yung FDA.

asr-004907
04:27:04.340 --> 04:27:14.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi nung po ating budget briefing, nakita naman natin kung gano'ng kalaki at kadami ang backlog ng FDA at kung gano'ng kabagal yung proseso dahil nga po sa kakulangan ng tao.

asr-004908
04:27:14.380 --> 04:27:19.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So nung bilanggit nyo yung FDA sa conversation, natakot ako na baka mas talong bumagal pa.

asr-004909
04:27:20.240 --> 04:27:26.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Inuulit ko lang po, this is WHO recommended at pwede rin pong US FDA approval since June 2025.

asr-004910
04:27:27.000 --> 04:27:31.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pag sinabi pong fast track, gano'ng po kabilis yung fast track, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague?

asr-004911
04:27:34.340 --> 04:27:41.180
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, meron naman pong commitment with the leadership of FDA para i-fast track po ito.

asr-004912
04:27:42.340 --> 04:27:47.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po. Hinihingi po sana natin, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, ay ano po ang ibig sabihin ng fast track?

asr-004913
04:27:47.920 --> 04:27:52.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po sa Tagalog ang fast track? Ilang araw, ilang linggo, ilang buwan?

asr-004914
04:27:58.560 --> 04:28:03.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Inuulit ko po. Pasensya na kayo. I'm taking off from our discussion during the budget briefing.

asr-004915
04:28:03.660 --> 04:28:08.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Na talagang maraming natitenga sa FDA dahil sa kakulangan ng tao.

asr-004916
04:28:31.700 --> 04:28:33.700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, to give the exact

asr-004917
04:28:33.700 --> 04:28:35.270
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: number of days,

asr-004918
04:28:36.260 --> 04:28:40.780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: It will be 20 days upon submission of compliance.

asr-004919
04:28:41.540 --> 04:28:46.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, has the compliance been submitted, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague?

asr-004920
04:28:46.940 --> 04:28:48.760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At this time, hindi pa po.

asr-004921
04:28:49.680 --> 04:28:51.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kailan pa ang ating target submission of compliance?

asr-004922
04:28:51.700 --> 04:28:53.280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: For the local...

asr-004923
04:28:58.040 --> 04:29:02.660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Sa local CPR, October 9 po magsasubmit.

asr-004924
04:29:02.900 --> 04:29:03.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: October 9?

asr-004925
04:29:03.660 --> 04:29:04.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, 20 days after.

asr-004926
04:29:05.120 --> 04:29:09.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, 20 days after. Ito po ba ay working or calendar days, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague?

asr-004927
04:29:09.780 --> 04:29:12.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pasensya na po. Makulit ako kasi February pa po ito eh.

asr-004928
04:29:12.760 --> 04:29:17.280
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Wala pong problema, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague. These are calendar days.

asr-004929
04:29:17.760 --> 04:29:21.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Calendar days. So, we're looking at around October 29, no?

asr-004930
04:29:21.960 --> 04:29:27.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi ko na po tatanungin kung ilan yung unagi HIV positive every day kasi alam naman po natin na report naman yan po ulit-ulit.

asr-004931
04:29:28.320 --> 04:29:29.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: That's 47 a day.

asr-004932
04:29:31.060 --> 04:29:33.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Yung 47 a day po, yan yung own natin.

asr-004933
04:29:33.660 --> 04:29:36.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Test natin at i-detect na positive sa HIV infection.

asr-004934
04:29:36.800 --> 04:29:44.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, if we're gonna do the math, that's 9,870 Filipinos na nagka-HIV in the past 7 months.

asr-004935
04:29:45.060 --> 04:29:50.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: In the past 7 months, na-delayed po ang rollout ng Lenacapavir.

asr-004936
04:29:51.180 --> 04:29:54.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sabi po sa internet, a condom could have prevented this.

asr-004937
04:29:54.980 --> 04:29:59.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And yes, in this case, Lenacapavir could have prevented this.

asr-004938
04:30:00.000 --> 04:30:05.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: A 2026 modeling study projected that with more rapid intake of Lenacapavir,

asr-004939
04:30:06.200 --> 04:30:13.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: approximately 23,800 HIV infections could be averted from 2026 to 2030.

asr-004940
04:30:14.620 --> 04:30:17.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakalaking tulong po ang donation na ito.

asr-004941
04:30:17.280 --> 04:30:22.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: It can save lives. It is our game changer, lalo na sa ating young key population.

asr-004942
04:30:23.680 --> 04:30:26.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Tayo po ay fast and furious pa rin pagdating sa infection.

asr-004943
04:30:27.140 --> 04:30:29.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: One of the highest, if not the highest, in the region.

asr-004944
04:30:29.340 --> 04:30:31.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And this is a game changer.

asr-004945
04:30:32.840 --> 04:30:39.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Lenacapavir now has a WHO recommendation, a pre-qualification, and a donation.

asr-004946
04:30:39.560 --> 04:30:42.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sitting on the table waiting for a signature.

asr-004947
04:30:43.120 --> 04:30:45.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Donation na po ito ha, choosy pa ba tayo?

asr-004948
04:30:47.540 --> 04:30:51.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya ang tanong po ng taong bayan at ng mga kapwa natin advocates,

asr-004949
04:30:51.620 --> 04:30:57.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ano pa ang hinihintayin natin para magligtas ng mas marami nating mga kababayan?

asr-004950
04:30:58.280 --> 04:30:59.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker,

asr-004951
04:30:59.340 --> 04:31:00.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-004952
04:31:00.340 --> 04:31:02.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: let me move on to another topic.

asr-004953
04:31:02.340 --> 04:31:07.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito na po, last na po kasi nag-promise ako ng 20 minutes kaya na po medyo nahaba ng konti.

asr-004954
04:31:07.340 --> 04:31:13.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This representation would like to be updated on the commitment made by the leadership of PhilHealth

asr-004955
04:31:13.340 --> 04:31:18.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: to expand the maternal care package to address rapid repeat pregnancies.

asr-004956
04:31:18.340 --> 04:31:21.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May nabanggit na po kayo kanina, additional coverage.

asr-004957
04:31:21.340 --> 04:31:28.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Noong committee hearing po, nagkaroon tayo ng pagkakataon na mga isa publiko ang nakababahalang bilang ng mga kababaihang Pilipinas.

asr-004960
04:31:30.340 --> 04:31:39.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na nakakaranas ng rapid repeat pregnancies o ang sunod-sunod na pagkabuntis sa loob lamang ng 24 buwan or 2 years

asr-004961
04:31:39.340 --> 04:31:48.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po ay may negative health outcomes, hindi lamang sa nanay, kundi at pati sa baby, kasama na ang risk ng maternal at infant death.

asr-004963
04:31:49.320 --> 04:31:50.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nais po nating malaman mula sa DOH

asr-004964
04:31:50.320 --> 04:31:58.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at PhilHealth, magkakaroon po ba tayo ng short-acting commodities sa ating maternity care package as part of postpartum care?

asr-004966
04:31:59.340 --> 04:32:13.660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, ito po ay bahagi ng MCP or yung Maternal Care Package

asr-004967
04:32:13.660 --> 04:32:22.900
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at ma-implement po ito sa third quarter of 2027.

asr-004968
04:32:25.300 --> 04:32:29.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At hanggang ilan buwan po ang ibibigay natin short-acting contraceptives?

asr-004969
04:32:29.500 --> 04:32:31.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-004970
04:32:31.260 --> 04:32:32.960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Three months po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004971
04:32:33.660 --> 04:32:34.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Three months, no?

asr-004972
04:32:36.160 --> 04:32:42.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Are these contraceptives for proper spacing to be given free to mothers as part of MCP?

asr-004973
04:32:43.400 --> 04:32:47.560
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Tama po yun. It will be given for free, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

asr-004974
04:32:47.880 --> 04:32:56.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, kasama po ba sa budget para dito sa expanded MCP sa ating 2027 budget?

asr-004975
04:32:58.020 --> 04:32:59.000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kasama po.

asr-004976
04:32:59.340 --> 04:33:00.100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

asr-004977
04:33:00.100 --> 04:33:06.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Magkano po ang tinataya natin kailangan budget na kakailanganin for the implementation of the expanded MCP, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor?

asr-004978
04:33:14.870 --> 04:33:27.400
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: For the MCP or Maternal Care Package, it is 6 billion for hospital services and 4.7 billion for non-hospital services.

asr-004979
04:33:27.460 --> 04:33:29.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Saan po dyan papasok ang implant?

asr-004980
04:33:29.340 --> 04:33:31.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: It's covered po ba?

asr-004981
04:33:40.280 --> 04:33:52.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Naalala ko po kasi when our Deputy Speaker, former DOH Secretary Janet Garin was DOH Secretary, talagang pinapaliwanag niya sa atin yung kahilagahan noong pag-consider as an option yung implant.

asr-004982
04:33:52.380 --> 04:33:57.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi alimbawa po noon, ang issue natin na tinutukan noon ay early pregnancy, no?

asr-004983
04:33:57.480 --> 04:33:59.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At nakita po natin na yung mga...

asr-004984
04:33:59.340 --> 04:34:07.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Bata na nagbubuntis, kung sila ay mabibigyan po ng implant, at least two years po, pwede nila matapos yung pag-aaral nila na hindi sila magbubuntis.

asr-004985
04:34:07.120 --> 04:34:08.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So kasama po ba ito sa ating pakete?

asr-004986
04:34:09.440 --> 04:34:14.940
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague, yung implants po is a separate package.

asr-004987
04:34:15.660 --> 04:34:17.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And that would be under which package?

asr-004994
04:34:29.340 --> 04:34:31.820
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Under ng family planning, pero it is a separate package.

asr-004995
04:34:31.940 --> 04:34:32.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Okay.

asr-004996
04:34:32.520 --> 04:34:36.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Makaka-avail po ba dito ang ating mga teen moms, ang mga batang ina?

asr-004997
04:34:38.280 --> 04:34:41.340
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Opo, Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague.

asr-004998
04:34:42.100 --> 04:34:45.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami pong salamat, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-004999
04:34:45.840 --> 04:34:55.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This representation commends the new leadership of the DOH and PhilHealth for paying close attention to the unmet needs of Filipino women and other marginalized groups.

asr-005000
04:34:55.840 --> 04:34:59.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Lalo na po yung ating mga teen moms at mga batang ina.

asr-005001
04:34:59.080 --> 04:35:06.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kailangan-kailangan po natin ito because despite of our declining fertility rate, marami pa rin maternal at infant deaths.

asr-005002
04:35:06.740 --> 04:35:13.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Lumalaki pa ang undernourished at mga batang Pilipino at napapabayaan natin ang kalusugan ng pamilyang Pilipino.

asr-005003
04:35:14.360 --> 04:35:17.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you for responding to the call to expand the maternity care package.

asr-005004
04:35:18.240 --> 04:35:25.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And Akbayan fully supports the request of the DOH and PhilHealth to significantly and rightfully increase their budget for 2027.

asr-005005
04:35:25.840 --> 04:35:28.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, marami pong salamat.

asr-005006
04:35:29.080 --> 04:35:35.460
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker, at maraming salamat din po sa ating Deputy Minority Leader, Cendaña.

asr-005007
04:35:36.080 --> 04:35:36.680
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Majority Leader.

asr-005008
04:35:38.300 --> 04:35:48.440
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Bong Suntay of the 4th District of Quezon City to interpolate the proposed budget of the DOH.

asr-005009
04:35:49.160 --> 04:35:52.240
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Honorable Bong Suntay is hereby recognized.

asr-005010
04:35:52.240 --> 04:35:55.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005011
04:35:55.800 --> 04:35:58.240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: To our good sponsor, of course, to the

asr-005012
04:35:59.080 --> 04:36:02.900
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Department of Health family, magandang tanghali po sa inyong lahat.

asr-005013
04:36:03.060 --> 04:36:03.840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Magandang hapon.

asr-005014
04:36:08.040 --> 04:36:16.220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The Universal Healthcare Act, RA 11223, explicitly defines indirect contributors as Filipinos,

asr-005015
04:36:16.220 --> 04:36:24.340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: not categorized as direct contributors, including indigent, senior citizens, persons with disabilities,

asr-005016
04:36:25.080 --> 04:36:27.220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: whose health insurance premiums shall be subsidized

asr-005017
04:36:29.080 --> 04:36:30.040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: by the national government.

asr-005018
04:36:30.300 --> 04:36:37.700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: While the Universal Healthcare Act does not explicitly fix an exact peso amount for the premium of indirect contributors,

asr-005019
04:36:38.640 --> 04:36:46.520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the provisions on government premium subsidies is within the exact same provision as the premiums of direct contributors under Section 10

asr-005020
04:36:46.520 --> 04:36:52.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: and must be construed harmoniously.

asr-005021
04:36:52.460 --> 04:36:55.760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Historically and prior to the UHC Act,

asr-005022
04:36:56.580 --> 04:36:58.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the floor rate of direct contributors served...

asr-005023
04:36:59.080 --> 04:37:01.820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: as the benchmark for subsidized member.

asr-005024
04:37:02.480 --> 04:37:05.020
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But under the 2027 NEP,

asr-005025
04:37:06.080 --> 04:37:17.180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the 55.42 billion allocations for 30.74 million indirect contributors amounts to a meager 1,803 per beneficiary per year,

asr-005026
04:37:17.180 --> 04:37:20.500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: far below the premium for the lowest income floor.

asr-005027
04:37:21.720 --> 04:37:28.620
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So my question is, who sets the premium rate for indirect contributors and what legal and actual basis was used?

asr-005028
04:37:29.080 --> 04:37:37.460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In the 2027 NEP, to justify subsidizing vulnerable Filipinos at only 1,803 per year?

asr-005029
04:37:50.180 --> 04:37:52.600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleague,

asr-005030
04:37:53.960 --> 04:37:58.220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ito po yung katanungan na sinagot din po kanina,

asr-005031
04:37:58.340 --> 04:37:58.600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: yung discrepancy...

asr-005032
04:37:59.080 --> 04:38:03.200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: nung figures ng DBM at ng PhilHealth.

asr-005033
04:38:04.120 --> 04:38:08.260
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, di hamak na mas maliit yung figures ng DBM,

asr-005034
04:38:08.440 --> 04:38:10.540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: kaya pag dinivide nyo, talaga ang liit ng package.

asr-005035
04:38:10.700 --> 04:38:12.720
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, ang ginagawa po ng PhilHealth,

asr-005036
04:38:13.780 --> 04:38:20.400
