Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: maraming salamat sa DOH family

asr-006075
05:30:17.480 --> 05:30:19.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and of course to the two

asr-006076
05:30:19.060 --> 05:30:21.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: sponsors na kagabi pa

asr-006077
05:30:21.680 --> 05:30:23.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: nakita ko nandito. Thank you.

asr-006078
05:30:24.400 --> 05:30:25.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Maraming salamat sa inyo lahat.

asr-006079
05:30:25.680 --> 05:30:27.300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker

asr-006080
05:30:27.300 --> 05:30:29.700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and thank you, Honorable De Jesus.

