asr-006920
06:00:00.638 --> 06:00:06.300
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: complemented by continuing training and specialization across the broader health workforce.

asr-006921
06:00:06.300 --> 06:00:17.600
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And finally, the direction is a multidisciplinary tiered model of care with primary health care teams

asr-006922
