Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Last na lang po on mental health.

asr-006926
06:00:35.540 --> 06:00:37.960
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Ang ating sponsor ay naging governor din.

asr-006927
06:00:38.600 --> 06:00:40.060
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Ako po ay naging mayor din.

asr-006928
06:00:40.720 --> 06:00:45.900
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: At alam ko na malaki ang maitutulong ng local government units.

asr-006929
06:00:46.460 --> 06:00:51.740
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: So ito pong tanong ko ay masasagot yata as practitioner ng ating sponsor.

asr-006930
06:00:51.740 --> 06:00:59.740
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Ano po bang magagawa ng local government units para mas mapalakas ang ating programa sa mental health?

asr-006931
06:01:00.000 --> 06:01:11.320
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Dahil alam naman po natin na ito mga community-based programs na ito ay best na maha-handle ng mga local government units.

asr-006932
06:01:11.740 --> 06:01:21.800
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: At meron po bang assistance na makukuha galing po sa Department of Health kung sakasakali man po ay may mga interesado mga local government units to pursue this?

asr-006933
06:01:30.000 --> 06:01:36.200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleen, tama po.

asr-006934
06:01:36.840 --> 06:01:39.780
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Of course, the people on the ground should know the condition better.

asr-006935
06:01:39.940 --> 06:01:49.440
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Being a former mayor ng ating distinguished colleague, ako rin po dati nag-mayor at nag-governor, so alam po natin yung nangyayari.

asr-006936
06:01:49.440 --> 06:01:54.220
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At yung pangangailangan nitong problema na ito on the ground.

asr-006937
06:01:54.740 --> 06:01:58.760
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, kanya-kanyang sitwasyon po at konteksto.

asr-006938
06:01:59.360 --> 06:01:59.540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Per L.A.

asr-006939
06:02:00.000 --> 06:02:15.000
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At katulad po sa Lalawigan ng Bataan, ay constant yung aming mahigpit na partnership with the DOH and DOH hospitals

asr-006940
06:02:15.000 --> 06:02:29.500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: in order to amplify all these services that I mentioned in the locality, especially sa mga schools, sa mga communities, at sa mga barangay.

asr-006941
06:02:30.000 --> 06:02:33.700
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, mapalad po kami sa Lalawigan ng Bataan.

asr-006942
06:02:33.840 --> 06:02:42.140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Meron kaming Mariveles Mental Health Facility and this is under the DOH.

asr-006943
06:02:42.140 --> 06:02:54.740
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kaya ito po yung natatap ng aming mga barangay captain, mga mayors, at ng aming mga mawamayan para makakuha kaagad ng mga serbisyo with regards to mental health.

asr-006944
06:02:55.080 --> 06:02:59.140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, our local chief executive, constantly.

asr-006945
06:03:00.000 --> 06:03:07.400
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Enhances all these programs nang sa ganon ma-address itong lumalaking mental health challenge natin.

asr-006946
06:03:07.960 --> 06:03:09.920
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, Honorable Colleen.

asr-006947
06:03:10.580 --> 06:03:21.600
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Tulad rin po ng Bataan, maswerte rin po ang First District ng Albay kasi meron po kami mismo sa Tabaco na private institution na nagpa-provide ng mental health services.

asr-006948
06:03:21.600 --> 06:03:28.600
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: At nasa amin rin po yung malinaw na treatment and rehabilitation center.

asr-006949
06:03:30.000 --> 06:03:35.360
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: So, ngayon po, I think ay accredited na ng PhilHealth para magbigay ng mental health services.

asr-006950
06:03:36.080 --> 06:03:41.460
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Isa na lang pong tanong tungkol sa, gasgas na ito, pero tungkol sa syntaxes.

asr-006951
06:03:42.080 --> 06:03:49.440
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Alam po, halos lahat po ng nauna nagtanong ay nagtanong na kung magkano nga ba talagang naka-allocate or earmark funds.

asr-006952
06:03:50.320 --> 06:03:57.360
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Very clear na hindi lahat nung earmark funds ay nare-receive ng PhilHealth at ng DOH.

asr-006953
06:03:58.520 --> 06:03:59.880
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Hindi rin lahat po.

asr-006957
06:04:00.000 --> 06:04:04.720
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Ang mga nakalagay sa budget ay actually na-re-release yung pondo.

asr-006958
06:04:05.380 --> 06:04:14.760
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Malaki rin po ang gap, kaya malaki rin po ang kakulangan sa pag-expand ng mga PhilHealth benefits para sa ating mga beneficiaries.

asr-006959
06:04:15.580 --> 06:04:26.360
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Pero gusto ko po malaman na lang, hindi na yung sa PhilHealth, sa DOH, paano po ba ginagamit yung 10% para sa MAIFIP at para sa HFEP?

asr-006960
06:04:26.800 --> 06:04:29.960
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: At ano po yung outcomes nito?

asr-006961
06:04:29.960 --> 06:04:38.140
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Hindi lang po kung magkano yung amount at kung saan napunta yung pera, pero ano po yung naging resulta nito, outcomes?

asr-006962
06:04:42.480 --> 06:04:56.720
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Abang po nag-confer, gusto ko lang po sabihin kasi ngayon pinag-uusapan na naman natin under the Progress Bill na dagdagan o itaas ang syntaxes sa tobacco, sa alcohol, sa sweetened beverages.

asr-006963
06:04:56.720 --> 06:04:59.620
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Pero mainam pong malaman ang publiko.

asr-006964
06:04:59.620 --> 06:05:15.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Kung paano po ginamit yung mga pondong ito bago tayo humingi uli ng mandato para mabigyan ng karagdagan na alokasyon sa buwis ang PhilHealth at ang DOH?

asr-006965
06:05:15.040 --> 06:05:20.040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker, Mr. Speaker, Madam Colleague.

asr-006966
06:05:21.540 --> 06:05:29.060
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Tama po kayo sa syntax law, 20% is allocated for HFEP and MAIFIP.

asr-006967
06:05:29.620 --> 06:05:48.020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At katulad po ng nabanggit kanina, kasalukuyan po yung ating bagong liderato ng DOH, ini-inventaryo yung mga na-implement at patuloy na mga ini-implement ng mga healthcare facilities.

asr-006968
06:05:48.500 --> 06:05:59.020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Nang sa ganon, makita kayo yung mga nag-ooperate ng maayos, yung hindi nag-ooperate, para ano yung mga gaps para ma-operate ito at mapakinabangan ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-006969
06:05:59.620 --> 06:06:14.500
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And moving forward with regards to the health facilities, masihigpitan po yung bagong MOA with the LGUs para siguradong mag-comply.

asr-006970
06:06:14.500 --> 06:06:29.420
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: If they requested for a new health facility, dapat lamang yung pinagkasunduan na personnel and other requirements ay maibigay nila.

asr-006971
06:06:29.620 --> 06:06:36.460
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Nang sa ganon, hindi po ito matenga at mapakinabangan kagad ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-006972
06:06:36.460 --> 06:06:55.800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Sa MAIFIP naman po, we can submit a report, pero if I may say, ito po naman yung natatakbuhan ng ating mga kababayan habang ini-increase po natin at ini-institutionalize yung ating universal healthcare under the PhilHealth.

asr-006973
06:06:55.800 --> 06:06:58.800
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So as you may know, madam...

asr-006974
06:06:59.620 --> 06:07:19.920
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Olig, yung PhilHealth packages addresses probably on the average 15%, 20% of the 19%, so around 20% of the out-of-pocket ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-006975
06:07:19.920 --> 06:07:27.060
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So habang in-expand po ito, kahit pa paano natatakbuhan po ng ating mga kababayan yung MAIFIP.

asr-006976
06:07:27.070 --> 06:07:31.100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So for example, sa 100,000 pesos,

asr-006977
06:07:31.100 --> 06:07:58.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Kung 20 pesos masasagot ng PhilHealth package, yung ibang bahagi ay pwedeng punan ng ating MAIFIP and I mentioned earlier, improve din po ito ng bagong liderato ng DOH at ng PhilHealth para yung mga private hospitals naman na nakakatanggap nung MAIFIP ay mas ma-improve pa.

asr-006978
06:07:58.380 --> 06:07:59.380
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So for example...

asr-006979
06:07:59.620 --> 06:08:16.620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So for example, ilalagay na nating requirement na yung 10% na bed capacity allocated for ward services and this will open up thousands and probably tens of thousands of hospital beds across the country.

asr-006980
06:08:18.300 --> 06:08:25.580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Magkakaroon na po ng tamang halaga ng pagsingil ng hospital bill and professional fees.

asr-006981
06:08:25.580 --> 06:08:28.580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At bukod po dyan, yung tinatanggihan na...

asr-006982
06:08:29.620 --> 06:08:44.100
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At professional fee, kaya hindi pa rin makalabas yung ating mga kababayan kahit na may pondo naman na pwedeng kunin, magkakaroon ng opt-in inclusion sa MOA.

asr-006983
06:08:44.600 --> 06:08:55.260
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Nang sa ganon, if we entered into a MOA, understood na kailangan i-comply natin itong mga requirements na ito na mas papakinabangan ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-006984
06:08:55.260 --> 06:08:58.400
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So that is the utilization.

asr-006985
06:08:59.620 --> 06:09:14.880
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Right now, of our HFEP and MAIFIP, and tama po kayo, Madam Colleague, Mr. Chair, malaki pa rin po yung balansi dito and hopefully masingil po ng DOH at PhilHealth.

asr-006986
06:09:15.080 --> 06:09:18.040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Nang sa ganon, mas maramdaman po ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-006987
